{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00445",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 5.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I've settled them in, ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.76,
      "end_seconds": 11.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.14,
      "end_seconds": 25.81,
      "duration_seconds": 12.67,
      "text": "I mean, uh, I've been dealing with sneezing fits. It's a relief to finally sit down and and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.97,
      "end_seconds": 29.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "how long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.23,
      "end_seconds": 44.79,
      "duration_seconds": 13.56,
      "text": "So, I've had it for three weeks. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.98,
      "end_seconds": 55.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.89,
      "end_seconds": 75.34,
      "duration_seconds": 19.45,
      "text": "It sort of comes and goes. Antihistamines helps a bit. I'd call it moderate. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.95,
      "end_seconds": 78.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.64,
      "end_seconds": 105.59,
      "duration_seconds": 25.95,
      "text": "A runny nose goes along with it, most of the time. The runny nose? That's been for three weeks. As for runny nose, about a seven out of ten. Oh, you know, and a dry cough. That's been about the same, three days. With dry cough, I'd say on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 123.12,
      "end_seconds": 133.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pressure 125 over 81, respiratory rate 15, pulse 64, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.55,
      "end_seconds": 134.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.35,
      "end_seconds": 138.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "let me examine, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.21,
      "end_seconds": 140.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.01,
      "end_seconds": 146.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "so, a little pressure here, tell me if it's tender"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.68,
      "end_seconds": 168.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Chest is clear, no wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.31,
      "end_seconds": 172.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Okay, just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.44,
      "end_seconds": 184.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "The inside of your nose is pale and swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.17,
      "end_seconds": 190.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Right, you can sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.49,
      "end_seconds": 207.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Any loss of smell, facial pain or wheezing at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.19,
      "end_seconds": 217.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "Right, you know, no loss of smell, facial pain or wheezing, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.44,
      "end_seconds": 220.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.15,
      "end_seconds": 225.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "not at all, you know, no fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.47,
      "end_seconds": 232.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.14,
      "end_seconds": 237.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.05,
      "end_seconds": 241.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.74,
      "end_seconds": 248.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Right, you know, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.29,
      "end_seconds": 253.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.48,
      "end_seconds": 259.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "It's, It's hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.28,
      "end_seconds": 263.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.94,
      "end_seconds": 270.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "for nearly five years. Cetirizine, 10 milligrams, when it flares"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.82,
      "end_seconds": 276.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.37,
      "end_seconds": 288.08,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Uh, I have eczema. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.15,
      "end_seconds": 294.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Mm. Alright, eczema, that matches what I have here. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.92,
      "end_seconds": 300.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Just a lump removed from my back, years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.4,
      "end_seconds": 304.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Anything special about your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.54,
      "end_seconds": 310.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I try to avoid too much sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.71,
      "end_seconds": 313.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "do you get any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.55,
      "end_seconds": 320.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I walk for about half an hour most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.88,
      "end_seconds": 327.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Before I prescribe anything, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.94,
      "end_seconds": 334.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Right, uh, I don't have any known medication allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.81,
      "end_seconds": 353.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is allergic rhinitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.26,
      "end_seconds": 359.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.45,
      "end_seconds": 393.99,
      "duration_seconds": 32.54,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's allergic rhinitis, and we'll know more once the an allergy test is back. I'll request an allergy test, it'll help with allergic rhinitis. For this, fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, one spray each side daily, for four weeks. It's for allergic rhinitis. Keep the the windows closed in the early morning and wash the bedsheets weekly in hot water"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.66,
      "end_seconds": 406.06,
      "duration_seconds": 11.4,
      "text": "if the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. I'd like you back in a month. Alright, do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.5,
      "end_seconds": 412.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "So, you know, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.46,
      "end_seconds": 415.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Goodbye."
    }
  ]
}